rooms_desc ({"You are standing on a dimly lit city street in a bad half of town.Your face gets wet as the rain falls from the dark sky. The onlylight you can see is comeing from the buildings around you. Youcan not help but wounder who would want to live in a place like this.The building next to you seems to catch your attention. In the backroundyou can hear people screeming and smell fire. A typical day, but youcan not get over the feeling that you are being watched. You look aroundat the cars and allys but see no one. It continues to rian.","You have entered a dark ally on the side of the buildings. It isdamp and smells very bad here. Trashcans line the walls andthere is a fire in one of them. You can see signs of a fught allaround you. There is blood every where and broken wood covers thefloor around you. You can see a man lieing on the ground about10 feet ahead of you next to a wall, it isnt moveing. Gettingcloser to it you can see shiny objects sticking out of his chest.Tin-Tin is here.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"DETROIT","A DARK ALLY","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
